<title>DUBAI: Oman's Sultan Qaboos meets Britain's defence chief.</title>
<headline>Oman's Sultan Qaboos meets Britain's defence chief.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1996-10-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oman's Sultan Qaboos met British Defence Secretary Michael Portillo in the Omani capital Muscat on Sunday to discuss bilateral ties and issues of mutual interest, the official Oman News Agency said.</p>
<p>The agency did not disclose further details of the meeting or of Portillo's visit to the Gulf state.</p>
